<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Love for You, Martha ❤️</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background: url('https://source.unsplash.com/1600x900/?romantic,hearts,love') no-repeat center center fixed;
            background-size: cover;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .overlay {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
        }
        .container {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            background: rgba(255, 192, 203, 0.9);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 182, 193, 0.8);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #ff0040;
            font-size: 3em;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #660033;
        }
        .love-message {
            font-size: 1.7em;
            color: #ff4081;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 700px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.8);
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 1.3em;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #fff;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }
        audio {
            display: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="overlay"></div>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>My Forever Love, Martha ❤️</h1>
        <p>From the moment you walked into my life, you became my world, my heart, my everything.</p>
        <p>Your smile is my sunshine, your voice is my melody, and your love is the air I breathe.</p>
        <p>I never want to lose you, because without you, my world would be incomplete. 💖</p>

        <img src="YOUR_IMAGE_LINK_1.jpg" alt="Martha - My Love">
        <p class="love-message">"You are the poetry my heart will always recite. ❤️"</p>

        <img src="YOUR_IMAGE_LINK_2.jpg" alt="Martha - My Everything">
        <p class="love-message">"With you, every heartbeat is a love song. 💖"</p>

        <div class="footer">Happy Valentine's Day, my love. I will cherish you forever. 🌹</div>
    </div>

    <audio autoplay loop>
        <source src="https://www.bensound.com/bensound-music/bensound-romantic.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    </audio>

</body>
</html>
